title: "base_dl_project: a minimal deep-learning project template built on the BaseModel interface"
abstract: >-
  Minimal deep-learning project template built around the `BaseModel` interface
  (preprocessing + architecture + postprocessing), with checkpointing, a training
  loop and keras-free runtimes — part of the yui-mhcp projects.
